WEBVTT

00:06.527 --> 00:11.027
<i>Kosaku Kawajiri's shoes
are a little big on me.</i>

00:11.907 --> 00:13.533
<i>To avert suspicion,</i>

00:13.576 --> 00:16.954
<i>I have to gradually swap
them out with ones that fit me.</i>

00:24.128 --> 00:25.295
Hayato.

00:28.215 --> 00:30.467
No goodbye?

00:36.932 --> 00:38.558
Have a pleasant day.

00:42.062 --> 00:42.979
Hurry, come quick!

00:43.022 --> 00:45.107
Something horrible's downstairs!

00:46.692 --> 00:51.192
It was so scary!
I thought I was going to die!

00:52.156 --> 00:53.824
<i>Scar yas that was,</i>

00:53.908 --> 00:57.536
<i>now I get to melt into the arms of
the handsome man I love so much.</i>

00:57.620 --> 00:59.163
<i>Oh Honey, oh Sweety, oh Baby!</i>

01:03.626 --> 01:06.920
It's so eerie…
a strange cat is in our basement!

01:07.838 --> 01:09.005
A cat?

01:11.383 --> 01:13.051
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:13.761 --> 01:15.846
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:16.639 --> 01:18.557
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:19.809 --> 01:22.895
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

01:22.978 --> 01:24.104
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:24.146 --> 01:28.646
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

01:29.693 --> 01:34.193
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

01:35.366 --> 01:39.866
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

01:40.996 --> 01:45.496
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

01:46.293 --> 01:50.793
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

01:53.676 --> 01:58.176
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>

02:03.519 --> 02:08.019
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

02:08.524 --> 02:13.024
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

02:14.864 --> 02:19.364
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

02:19.827 --> 02:24.327
<i>Our courage keeps the town in bloom</i>

02:25.374 --> 02:29.586
<i>Great Days</i>

02:32.548 --> 02:36.760
EPISODE 30
CATS LOVE YOSHIKAGE KIRA

02:32.590 --> 02:35.551
It was really scary cause, cause…

02:35.593 --> 02:36.781
Well, we were out of
mineral water and…

02:38.470 --> 02:41.306
I thought I'd get some more
down in the basement.

02:42.016 --> 02:44.268
Of course, I love cats.

02:44.476 --> 02:48.271
I thought,
"What a sweet British Shorthair."

02:48.314 --> 02:50.149
It had perfect proportions,

02:50.316 --> 02:54.816
and those gorgeous yellow eyes
and velvety bluish-gray fur.

02:55.571 --> 02:57.281
<i>Now how did you get in here?</i>

02:57.323 --> 02:58.782
<i>It's okay sweetie-pie…</i>

03:00.618 --> 03:02.453
<i>Oh, don't be scared.</i>

03:06.916 --> 03:09.126
<i>That must be how he got in.</i>

03:09.209 --> 03:12.712
<i>But he can't stay
down here forever.</i>

03:13.047 --> 03:16.633
<i>He might pee on that potato sack.</i>

03:16.842 --> 03:18.969
<i>He probably has fleas.</i>

03:19.970 --> 03:23.556
<i>Just avoid eye contact and
approach nice and slow, right?</i>

03:28.938 --> 03:33.438
<i>That's it. I just need to show him
I'm not a threat.</i>

03:34.109 --> 03:37.654
<i>See? I'm showing you my belly
and being submissive.</i>

03:37.821 --> 03:40.365
<i>Let's be friends.</i>

03:45.454 --> 03:48.999
<i>Why should I have to beg
for this cat's attention?</i>

03:50.417 --> 03:52.669
<i>Scram, or you're gonna get it!</i>

03:52.795 --> 03:54.546
<i>Got it? Don't test me!</i>

03:57.591 --> 03:58.592
<i>Darn it!</i>

04:03.222 --> 04:04.223
<i>You little!</i>

04:07.226 --> 04:10.520
He clung to the ceiling
like an insect!

04:11.021 --> 04:14.357
But the scariest part was…

04:14.441 --> 04:18.941
That cat… right around his throat…
he had a gapping hole.

04:19.196 --> 04:21.698
A hole as big as a one-yen coin!

04:21.865 --> 04:24.117
And then, from the opening,
I heard…

04:24.076 --> 04:25.744
MREOW

04:26.120 --> 04:27.871
A hole?

04:28.497 --> 04:31.791
<i>Could it be a wound
from the arrow?</i>

04:32.001 --> 04:36.046
I swung the broom at him like
a mad woman before he ran away.

04:36.338 --> 04:38.882
Please, can you go down there
and look?

04:38.924 --> 04:40.467
I'm really scared.

04:40.843 --> 04:43.220
You said… he had a gash?

04:45.889 --> 04:49.434
Hey… Is he gone? Did he run away?

04:50.853 --> 04:52.396
No… He's dead.

04:52.438 --> 04:55.149
Huh? What are you talking about?

04:56.692 --> 04:57.943
W-Wait…

04:58.068 --> 05:00.570
Glass from the bottles
cut his throat.

05:00.738 --> 05:03.323
Wait a minute! I was just—

05:03.365 --> 05:04.741
It was an accident.

05:04.825 --> 05:08.662
It's no one's fault. Just bad luck.

05:11.915 --> 05:13.541
You didn't do anything wrong.

05:14.293 --> 05:15.752
No one did anything wrong.

05:19.423 --> 05:20.924
Apparently,
he had a gash in his throat

05:21.008 --> 05:22.426
before the accident, but…

05:22.801 --> 05:26.095
Now there's no telling
he was a Stand user.

05:26.263 --> 05:29.599
But I'm certain he wasn't…

05:57.461 --> 06:00.297
<i>Good morning, Morioh.</i>

06:00.339 --> 06:03.342
<i>Nothing better than the morning
after heavy rain, right?</i>

06:03.592 --> 06:06.803
<i>On my way to the studio,
I saw a beautiful rainbow</i>

06:06.887 --> 06:08.430
<i>Wonder if it's still there?</i>

06:12.976 --> 06:15.019
<i>"What is this place, mrrp?</i>

06:15.395 --> 06:19.895
<i>Why am I here?
Meow, meow, "he thought.</i>

06:20.818 --> 06:24.154
<i>"Two days ago,
someone got me with an arrow,</i>

06:24.196 --> 06:26.281
<i>I thought I came out okay…"</i>

06:27.116 --> 06:30.244
<i>"M-My body's totally different!</i>

06:30.369 --> 06:32.954
<i>What happened to it…
It's all weird!</i>

06:33.205 --> 06:37.705
<i>Why am I stuck here?"
he meowed in perplexity</i>

06:40.295 --> 06:43.506
Where in the world did he bury him?

06:43.799 --> 06:47.511
I'm so sorry, sweetie.
May you rest in peace.

06:49.513 --> 06:53.183
<i>Then he wondered,
"Now who is this lady?</i>

06:54.184 --> 06:56.811
<i>I've got a real bad feeling
about her."</i>

06:57.813 --> 07:00.315
<i>"The broom! That's it!
Now I remember!</i>

07:00.732 --> 07:01.733
<i>This woman…</i>

07:02.317 --> 07:06.529
<i>That's right! All this glass got
stuck in me and I got paralyzed!</i>

07:06.613 --> 07:08.865
<i>I'm in this whole mess…</i>

07:08.949 --> 07:12.077
<i>because of that woman!"
he fumed</i>

07:22.629 --> 07:24.172
<i>Once again,
confusion overcame him.</i>

07:24.298 --> 07:26.466
<i>"What? Something just happened</i>

07:26.508 --> 07:30.053
<i>When I let my anger for
that lady out, something happened"</i>

07:30.345 --> 07:32.930
My toenail? W-Why?!

07:33.015 --> 07:36.685
Could it be a curse?
My god… from that cat?!

07:49.698 --> 07:52.701
<i>Having survived by his animal
instincts and inclinations,</i>

07:52.868 --> 07:57.368
<i>he intuitively understood
his new power and how to use it.</i>

08:02.711 --> 08:05.255
This little bastard's…
a Stand user!

08:05.547 --> 08:09.217
Why the hell is this thing growing
where I buried that cat?

08:09.301 --> 08:11.386
What in god's name is it?

08:12.888 --> 08:15.098
What did it do to that sparrow?

08:15.140 --> 08:17.100
I didn't spot any Stand.

08:18.060 --> 08:22.560
Most importantly,
should I consider it the enemy?

08:23.065 --> 08:25.942
Does it want me dead or…

08:26.985 --> 08:29.904
To be on the safe side,
I shall exterminate it.

08:38.497 --> 08:41.166
<i>Sleep after feeding.</i>

08:41.458 --> 08:44.836
<i>Is it a type of plant
or is it an animal?</i>

08:45.045 --> 08:46.796
<i>Eliminating it would be easy,</i>

08:47.089 --> 08:49.800
<i>but a little investigation
certainly won't hurt.</i>

08:55.264 --> 08:58.892
The way it almost innately
looked back at me when I called it

08:58.934 --> 09:01.019
seemed strangely cat like…

09:04.314 --> 09:08.484
The way it almost had to
sniff my hand is uniquely feline.

09:08.568 --> 09:11.279
It seems agreeable
to being petted as well.

09:13.282 --> 09:15.492
The way it's letting out
that eerie purr

09:15.534 --> 09:16.743
as it's about to fall asleep

09:16.785 --> 09:18.328
is almost exactly like
the way a cat purrs.

09:18.745 --> 09:23.245
But none of that tells me whether
it harbors any ill will toward me.

09:24.835 --> 09:26.211
I'll find out for sure.

09:35.470 --> 09:37.847
Hmm… It's angry,

09:37.931 --> 09:41.643
but now I know it doesn't
want to do me any harm.

09:41.893 --> 09:45.187
<i>There's no doubt, it's the cat
I buried here yesterday</i>

09:45.314 --> 09:49.192
<i>So it really did have a gouge
in its throat from the arrow!</i>

09:49.901 --> 09:51.277
Um, Honey?

09:52.237 --> 09:53.238
<i>It's her!</i>

09:56.366 --> 09:58.785
That spot scares me.

09:58.952 --> 10:02.455
That's where I lost my nail…

10:03.874 --> 10:07.711
<i>The cat attacked out of anger
for the woman!</i>

10:07.836 --> 10:10.630
<i>If she found out about this thing…</i>

10:12.549 --> 10:17.049
<i>Gossip would eventually spread to
Jotaro Kujo and his bratty cohorts!</i>

10:18.013 --> 10:19.723
<i>I can never let that happen!</i>

10:20.015 --> 10:23.101
That's where you
buried the cat, right?

10:23.268 --> 10:25.895
It feels like a curse.
I'm really scared…

10:26.521 --> 10:30.733
It's not buried here.
Now go back inside.

10:30.859 --> 10:31.985
You're lying!

10:32.027 --> 10:34.738
You're lying to protect me,
aren't you?

10:37.866 --> 10:42.078
<i>Shit! This cat means
trouble after all!</i>

10:42.162 --> 10:44.747
<i>I may not know
what its Stand can do,</i>

10:45.082 --> 10:46.374
<i>but I'll kill it nonetheless.</i>

10:46.708 --> 10:47.709
<i>Deadly Queen!</i>

10:54.341 --> 10:57.052
<i>I hate to do this, but you're
about to be permanently uprooted</i>

10:57.469 --> 11:00.513
<i>Bomb type one, switch on!</i>

11:03.308 --> 11:04.309
What?!

11:05.936 --> 11:08.605
<i>I, I don't…! It can't be a dud!</i>

11:08.688 --> 11:09.897
<i>So this thing did it?</i>

11:09.940 --> 11:12.609
<i>It has anti detonation abilities?</i>

11:14.319 --> 11:16.112
Huh? Is that a plant?

11:16.196 --> 11:17.739
Th-That plant is moving!

11:17.781 --> 11:19.699
I told you to get back inside!

11:19.741 --> 11:20.992
Huh?

11:26.623 --> 11:27.624
Shinobu!

11:32.337 --> 11:36.632
<i>The moment Deadly Queen's bomb
was batted away, it exploded!</i>

11:36.842 --> 11:38.760
<i>Could this thing's ability be…</i>

11:40.011 --> 11:43.014
<i>The cat-until-yesterday plant
thought to itself,</i>

11:43.223 --> 11:44.974
<i>"I will kill that woman!"</i>

11:46.101 --> 11:49.854
Your attacks on her end now.

11:49.980 --> 11:52.065
I'm about to make you disappear.

11:53.525 --> 11:56.444
<i>"If this man wants to get in
the way, then I'll kill him too!"</i>

11:57.028 --> 11:58.988
The only possible explanation
for the lack of explosion

11:59.030 --> 12:01.949
could be that it was
deprived of air.

12:02.367 --> 12:06.867
<i>The plant knew instinctively
the exact method of killing.</i>

12:08.331 --> 12:12.831
Could its Stand ability be
controlling the air?

12:16.131 --> 12:16.923
It's coming!

12:16.965 --> 12:18.883
I couldn't see,
but it fired something.

12:19.176 --> 12:20.677
Deadly Queen!

12:23.805 --> 12:26.224
It did shoot something at us.
It's air!

12:26.475 --> 12:28.351
It's weaponizing masses of air!

12:28.685 --> 12:31.604
You fetid feline!
I'll turn you into fertilizer!

12:34.149 --> 12:35.233
I can't stamp it out!

12:35.317 --> 12:38.028
It's like I'm pressing on
an invisible balloon!

12:38.153 --> 12:40.280
It really does manipulate the air.

12:41.948 --> 12:42.949
What?

12:46.953 --> 12:48.663
Dammit it…

12:52.709 --> 12:57.209
I can't see it, but it released
some kind of compressed air again.

12:57.672 --> 13:00.049
<i>Shit… Something's gonna happen!</i>

13:01.218 --> 13:02.219
What?

13:02.511 --> 13:03.637
The cactus!

13:03.970 --> 13:05.596
Sh-Shinobu!

13:12.896 --> 13:17.396
<i>I don't… Did Yoshikage Kira
just feel a sense of relief for…</i>

13:18.193 --> 13:21.404
<i>for the cactus needles
not hitting her eyes?</i>

13:21.530 --> 13:23.406
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

13:24.449 --> 13:27.618
<i>Could I be worried
about someone else?</i>

13:27.744 --> 13:29.078
<i>Huh, what was I thinking…</i>

13:29.412 --> 13:32.456
<i>My only concern is what
might happen if this woman dies</i>

13:32.541 --> 13:35.460
<i>and Jotaro Kujo discovers
I'm at this house!</i>

13:35.752 --> 13:39.505
<i>That's the only reason
I'm relieved</i>

13:40.173 --> 13:41.924
<i>Nothing more…</i>

13:43.718 --> 13:46.721
Your attack is now powerless
against me.

13:48.139 --> 13:50.516
Your projectiles may be
invisible to the eye,

13:50.559 --> 13:52.435
but I've deciphered
your little trick…

13:52.477 --> 13:54.937
You simply compress air and
launch it at your opponent

13:55.021 --> 13:56.731
in a scattering of projectiles.

13:57.148 --> 14:00.526
Deadly Queen is no longer
defenseless against your attack.

14:07.534 --> 14:08.743
<i>What?!</i>

14:09.619 --> 14:14.119
<i>Bastard… he injected
the mass of air into my vein!</i>

14:15.917 --> 14:18.628
<i>It's traveling deeper and deeper
into my body!</i>

14:19.421 --> 14:22.382
<i>I'm no doctor,
but I've heard enough to know…</i>

14:22.465 --> 14:26.093
<i>Injecting more than 10ccs
of any gas into a vein</i>

14:26.261 --> 14:28.304
<i>can cause blood vessel blockage
and death.</i>

14:29.014 --> 14:31.933
<i>This has to be more than 10ccs!</i>

14:32.142 --> 14:33.143
<i>Goddamnit!</i>

14:35.937 --> 14:37.480
It's no use! Blast it…

14:37.814 --> 14:40.650
There's no other way…
I have to do it.

14:40.775 --> 14:42.151
Deadly Queen!

14:49.075 --> 14:51.827
<i>I underestimated this thing.</i>

14:52.162 --> 14:55.498
<i>This power to control the air…</i>

14:55.582 --> 14:58.835
<i>It's more formidable than
I had imagined. What to do?</i>

15:00.754 --> 15:03.173
It's coming!
It's poised to attack again!

15:07.344 --> 15:08.345
<i>What can I do?</i>

15:25.153 --> 15:26.779
That was too close…

15:27.155 --> 15:29.699
<i>For now, I guess
I'll let it off the hook.</i>

15:30.325 --> 15:31.993
<i>I'll let it live for now.</i>

15:36.998 --> 15:39.542
STRAY CAT

15:40.752 --> 15:45.047
<i>I buried the cat far away,
he told me yesterday</i>

15:45.590 --> 15:48.551
<i>The cat's curse, as he said,</i>

15:48.635 --> 15:53.014
<i>was just a figment of
my imagination brought on by fear.</i>

15:53.515 --> 15:56.684
<i>I can't believe it…
I fainted right in front of him…</i>

15:56.726 --> 15:58.561
<i>I'm so embarrassed</i>

15:58.978 --> 15:59.853
<i>But…</i>

15:59.896 --> 16:03.983
<i>He was late for work
and still looked after me.</i>

16:04.234 --> 16:05.902
<i>It was wonderful.</i>

16:06.027 --> 16:09.655
<i>It felt like, at that moment,
he really understood me.</i>

16:09.698 --> 16:12.742
<i>It was the most blissful
morning of my life.</i>

16:21.876 --> 16:23.836
Well? Do you like it?

16:27.340 --> 16:28.549
That Hayato…

16:28.591 --> 16:31.635
He left without
saying goodbye again.

16:31.928 --> 16:35.056
<i>That little brat…
has he been watching me?</i>

16:35.140 --> 16:36.683
Oh, Sweetie!

16:36.933 --> 16:38.476
That's my plate.

16:39.436 --> 16:40.770
I know how you hate
shiitake mushrooms,

16:40.812 --> 16:42.438
so I made sure to take them out…

16:42.564 --> 16:44.607
Why the sudden change of heart?

16:46.192 --> 16:48.861
You've already eaten
more than half of mine.

16:50.572 --> 16:54.826
Don't get me wrong, I'm thrilled
you're wolfing it down.

16:55.326 --> 16:57.953
Not so bad when you
give them a chance, huh?

16:58.621 --> 16:59.622
Yes.

17:04.252 --> 17:06.254
Well, I'll be going now.

17:06.504 --> 17:08.714
Have a good day, Sweetie pie.

17:23.271 --> 17:27.566
Hey… a goodbye kiss
would've been nice.

17:27.776 --> 17:30.820
But we've never been closer.

17:31.112 --> 17:34.281
Before he knows it, my seductive
love will overwhelm him.

17:38.036 --> 17:40.997
<i>He put his shoes on
with a shoehorn.</i>

17:41.164 --> 17:44.876
<i>He was definitely wearing
25.5cm sized shoes.</i>

17:45.376 --> 17:48.670
<i>Who has shoes with
two different sizes…</i>

17:48.838 --> 17:52.258
<i>Plus, I've never seen
Mom and Dad get along so well.</i>

17:52.467 --> 17:53.593
<i>He even scarfed down</i>

17:53.635 --> 17:55.803
<i>those shiitake mushrooms
he hates so much.</i>

17:57.806 --> 17:59.516
This is weird, too.

17:59.599 --> 18:03.686
Why is he practicing writing
his name over and over?

18:04.479 --> 18:06.397
Then there's last night…

18:14.072 --> 18:17.450
I've watched it a million times…
That's a pot with dirt.

18:17.659 --> 18:20.703
And that has to be a bag of
cat food he's holding.

18:21.120 --> 18:24.373
He then proceeds
to walk into his closet…

18:47.021 --> 18:49.565
<i>They're all wearing hats.</i>

18:49.816 --> 18:51.901
<i>Is that compulsory?</i>

18:52.443 --> 18:55.487
Something… feels strangely off…

18:57.198 --> 18:58.949
The attic?

19:15.174 --> 19:19.674
W-What is that weird thing?

19:21.598 --> 19:24.100
It's too dark… I can't make it out.

19:36.696 --> 19:39.281
There it is. It's that bag.

19:40.992 --> 19:41.993
Huh?

19:49.083 --> 19:50.167
Wha—

19:50.251 --> 19:51.919
<i>I-It's moving!</i>

19:51.961 --> 19:54.421
<i>That's not a plant…
Those are eyes!</i>

19:54.464 --> 19:56.966
<i>Those are actual eyeballs
looking this way!</i>

19:57.425 --> 20:01.429
<i>Could that cat food be
for this creature?</i>

20:01.471 --> 20:02.722
Honey.

20:02.931 --> 20:04.140
What's the matter?

20:04.182 --> 20:05.766
Did you forget something?

20:05.808 --> 20:09.478
Or did you forget
my goodbye kiss?

20:09.562 --> 20:10.271
No…

20:10.271 --> 20:11.814
Aww…

20:11.898 --> 20:14.025
Then what is it?
Shall I get it for you?

20:14.108 --> 20:15.651
No, I can get it myself.

20:15.735 --> 20:17.570
Why did he come back?

20:18.196 --> 20:19.238
Oh no!

20:20.865 --> 20:21.866
Huh?!

20:24.577 --> 20:27.204
What?! Th-This thing…

20:28.247 --> 20:31.083
Something invisible,
something almost inflated…

20:31.167 --> 20:33.085
It's like masses of air

20:33.127 --> 20:36.130
have my arms and neck
nailed to thin air!

20:38.466 --> 20:41.427
He's coming up! Oh no!

20:48.309 --> 20:52.021
The attic! I knew it! That brat…

20:53.398 --> 20:56.192
<i>I-It attacked me
when I tried to shut the window?</i>

20:56.317 --> 20:59.361
<i>So it needs the sunlight to move?</i>

20:59.904 --> 21:03.657
<i>That's it!
If they are masses of air…</i>

21:12.500 --> 21:15.336
Yes! So it was the sunlight.

21:34.856 --> 21:36.524
That noise…

21:37.442 --> 21:40.903
Did Stray Cat try to get
the cat food from the shelf

21:40.987 --> 21:43.906
using its air-controlling abilities
and spill it on the floor?

21:44.282 --> 21:47.576
I thought the lack of sunlight
would keep it calm…

21:47.994 --> 21:51.247
Traces of light must be seeping in.

21:52.040 --> 21:53.291
Still…

21:53.875 --> 21:56.836
I suspected Hayato may have
rummaged around here,

21:57.045 --> 21:59.589
but I suppose I can chalk it up
to overthinking.

22:00.006 --> 22:03.968
Had that brat discovered
my true identity,

22:04.927 --> 22:07.596
I would have had to murder him.

22:15.146 --> 22:19.646
He has Dad's face,
but that's not Dad. Who…

22:20.818 --> 22:23.987
Wh-Who is it… who?!

23:38.938 --> 23:42.066
EPISODE 31
JULY 15TH (THURS), PART 1
